OL,3,GNEWSAViral US TikToker praises South
OL,4,AWest takeaways
OL,5,
OL,6,FA TikToker from Tennessee who became
OL,7,F"obsessed" with British food has given
OL,8,Fhis seal of approval to takeaway nosh
OL,9,Fin Devon and Cornwall.
OL,11,FKalani Smith, who goes by Kalani Ghost
OL,12,FHunter online, racks up millions of
OL,13,Fviews posting his reviews on social
OL,14,Fmedia and he recently finished a tour
OL,15,Fof the South West.
OL,17,FHe sampled pasties, spicy spuds and a
OL,18,Flocal ale on his visit - and he
OL,19,Fexplained he learned the hard way about
OL,20,Fthe jam and cream rivalry that remains
OL,21,Fa heavily contested point between the
OL,22,Fcounties.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
